      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "And from him, from Zurara, from Sama’at, ",
          "(It has been narrated) from Abu Abdullah<sup>asws</sup> regarding a Muslim man who kills a man from the <span class=\"iTxt\">Zimmy</span> people. So he<sup>asws</sup> said: ‘This is a harsh Hadeeth, the people cannot bear it, but the Zimmy has to give the wergild of the Muslim, then the Muslim would be killed due to it’."
        ]
      }
